==Latin==

===Etymology===
* Some say it to be for ''*prōprīvus'', from {{m|la|prīvus}} or ultimately from this root.
* Some say it to be for ''*prōpatrius'', from {{m|la|prō-}} + {{m|la|pater}}, meaning ''"from one's forefathers"'', taking Ancient Greek {{m|grc|προπάτωρ||forefather}} as comparison.

